Flow Steward Toolbox Dataset Connector
Copyright 2026 Flow Steward contributors

This extension packages MCP Toolbox for Databases 1.3.0 from
https://github.com/googleapis/mcp-toolbox at commit
b0010060a939455d91e4f8ba62dc3e72b1892469.

MCP Toolbox for Databases is Copyright 2024 Google LLC and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The complete license text is included in
LICENSE. The packaged linux-amd64 and linux-arm64 executables are reproducible
source builds because the upstream release does not publish a Linux arm64
artifact. Flow Steward applies the checked-in patch
scripts/patches/0001-flowsteward-driver-bound-query-params.patch so saved-query
values reach native RunSQL driver parameters without SQL interpolation. The
reproducible Docker build verifies the pinned commit, checks and applies the
patch, runs the affected Go tests, excludes Oracle, and builds both portable
Linux targets. Build tools and checksums are recorded in THIRD_PARTY.yml and
SHA256SUMS.
